s Palace","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"rUxxJi1tlSljiY_kTasUKA","review_id":"zk_lfzwDYVbf1pnfE8Dqyg","date":"2016-10-01T22:11:10","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9391005635261536,"text_excerpt":"The band playing when we were visiting was playing smooth jazz, which I am not a big fan of, but I guess seeing it live made it seem a little more likeable for me. They served hurricanes, sold Mexican food in the back, and had a big mural of Bob Marley at the stage where bands would perform. I'm not sure if this would be a bar one would expect to visit on Frenchmen Street but it is still cool and unique; fun crowd and chill vibes! Next time I do want to try the Mexican food here - it smelled REALLY GOOD."},{"business_id":"rUxxJi1tlSljiY_kTasUKA","review_id":"r_9v5SNeUFYs1G5f9oRYbw","date":"2014-04-23T07:18:03","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9306618571281433,"text_excerpt":"One of our favorite spots on our entire New Orleans adventure. -$3 soft tacos (and other items on the menu) at a \"restaurant\" inside of the bar... SOLID tacos. -$5 beers (bottled beers only though... no tap available... would be better if there were better and more local tap options than the bottled Abita, Sierra Nevada, Newcastle, and other universal brands) - NO Cover (and not a line in sight.... at least the 3 times in 4 nights that we ended up here) - Great live music..... all types of music on any given night. One of the notables from our time there was a band called Another Day In Paradise. Solid sax/horn work, sirs. Divey feel to the bar, although it's not often that you have tens ..."},{"business_id":"rUxxJi1tlSljiY_kTasUKA","review_id":"0v4_zZHPy0GQRRdbWT7qDg","date":"2013-07-26T22:31:12","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9274691343307495,"text_excerpt":"One of our go-to spots on Frenchmen St. Awesome bands. I have never been here and NOT enjoyed the music. We have heard awesome Blues bands, Reggage Bands, R & B bands... you name it. No cover ever. The drinks I am not impressed with. I prefer well crafted cocktails. They don't seem to have those here. Best bet order a bottle of beer. The people watching is always great. I have never had any of the food offered in the back, but have heard first hand that it is really good & affordable."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"rUxxJi1tlSljiY_kTasUKA","photo_id":"6IlUKxzfmQqww3HjI3WfUQ","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/6IlUKxzfmQqww3HjI3WfUQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8829107284545898},{"business_id":"rUxxJi1tlSljiY_kTasUKA","photo_id":"kwAOPQElxTre63rKAB8CWA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/kwAOPQElxTre63rKAB8CWA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8829107284545898},{"business_id":"rUxxJi1tlSljiY_kTasUKA","photo_id":"t2TqV7r3wmLXoy5OVjRxzQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/t2TqV7r3wmLXoy5OVjRxzQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.848791241645813},{"business_id":"rUxxJi1tlSljiY_kTasUKA","photo_id